   "definition_quote": "In the stochastic setting, the reward vector $r_t$ at time $t$ is independently drawn from a fixed reward distribution with expectation $\\EE{r_t} = \\mu$. Denote $i^* = \\argmax_{i\\in V}\\mu_i$ as the optimal arm, which we assume is unique ... we consider a general observable graph, i.e., $N^{\\mathrm{in}}(i)\\neq\\emptyset$ for each arm $i\\in V$."
